    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "And when I had on the high right to life representative about three weeks ago, she pointed out that the proposal this fall would include gender affirming care. By that we mean that if you're a 14 year old daughter wants to become a male that the parents have no say in whether or not a 14-year-old can transition without their knowledge or consent. But on the other hand, if a kid needs three stitches and a knee, then the parents have got to consent. They've got to be there, sign the forms. But it also, it isn't just about abortion. It's going to be about switching your gender without the knowledge of parents, without their permission. During those difficult times, a mother's guidance to a child is extremely important. and to take that out of the hands of the parent and given in the medical system where do you stand on that if anywhere",
