    "turn_text": "Now, the language is it was approved by David Yose is going to percolate the next several months. You find yourself this afternoon in East Palestine. There were many residents there thinking, OK, the governor or whatever the railroad was going to leave us alone. That's not the case. Can you describe to the American people what the state of Ohio government is going to do in East Palestine?",
