    "turn_text": "Could you, lastly, we had about a minute remaining. Do you see a circumstance soon when Norfolk Southern may buy out the people? If somebody says my home has no value, it had 80,000 or 100,000. Now it's worth zero. No one's going to buy my home. Are you going to push to have the railroad company buy the homes of individuals who don't want to live there and they have no value in their home?",
