    "turn_text": "I can't imagine anybody. So you've told that to the railroad, North Fork Southern, that if Tony Bender owns a home for $100,000 and he puts it on the market and the best pricing gets $50,000, you've told the railroad company, you owe Tony Bender $50,000.",
